WEBVTT

00:01.740 --> 00:03.077
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:03.101 --> 00:04.436
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.460 --> 00:07.676
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.700 --> 00:13.260
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.260 --> 01:31.220
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.380 --> 01:34.620
=Episode 14=

01:59.820 --> 02:01.896
Where are Ning Emei
and his Fengzi Battalion?

02:01.920 --> 02:03.946
One li behind us.
[♪li: unit of length, equals 500 meters.]

02:03.970 --> 02:04.937
When they're so far away,

02:04.961 --> 02:06.080
how can they protect you?

02:07.370 --> 02:08.720
We have Senior, don't we?

02:10.440 --> 02:12.345
Xu Fengnian is quite scheming.

02:12.795 --> 02:13.896
He has transferred Fengzi Battalion away

02:13.920 --> 02:15.420
because he expects assassins.

02:16.745 --> 02:17.856
When you use your martial arts,

02:17.880 --> 02:19.320
he'll know who you are?

02:20.280 --> 02:21.595
Clever girl.

02:22.895 --> 02:24.945
But he's got the wrong plan.

02:25.795 --> 02:26.921
Fengnian, I'll only keep you alive.

02:26.945 --> 02:28.096
Even if all your subordinates
are killed,

02:28.120 --> 02:29.120
I won't care.

02:33.570 --> 02:35.670
Fengnian should be
out of Yongzhou, right?

02:36.270 --> 02:37.771
Upon their traveling speed,

02:37.795 --> 02:39.120
he should be.

02:39.770 --> 02:40.970
Out of Yongzhou,

02:41.345 --> 02:42.625
they'll be arriving in Qingzhou.

02:43.470 --> 02:45.295
Lord of Jing'an in Qingzhou

02:45.420 --> 02:47.760
is always at loggerheads with us.

02:48.370 --> 02:49.971
I'm afraid

02:49.995 --> 02:51.870
His Highness will
have some mishaps there.

02:52.370 --> 02:53.370
Chu Lushan.

02:53.920 --> 02:54.920
Here.

02:55.270 --> 02:57.545
Don't go to the capital city with me.

02:58.145 --> 02:59.970
But I promised His Highness.

03:00.520 --> 03:02.080
How many days does it take

03:02.270 --> 03:04.240
when you travel light to Qingzhou?

03:05.270 --> 03:06.270
Two days only.

03:06.945 --> 03:07.945
Oh.

03:09.395 --> 03:10.395
You...

03:10.595 --> 03:12.256
Stay by the gate of my mansion.

03:12.280 --> 03:14.840
Once you receive the sword tassel
carried by the hawk,

03:14.945 --> 03:15.722
lead your cavalry

03:15.746 --> 03:17.800
to Qingzhou immediately.

03:18.445 --> 03:20.120
Godfather, you want me

03:20.520 --> 03:21.820
to invade Qingzhou?

03:22.220 --> 03:23.795
No, or we would be rebelling.

03:24.945 --> 03:26.896
Then what should I do in Qingzhou?

03:26.920 --> 03:28.795
Fengnian will tell you.

03:28.920 --> 03:30.545
What about you?

03:31.370 --> 03:33.920
Many people in the capital city
want me to be dead.

03:35.020 --> 03:36.960
But once I'm there,

03:37.095 --> 03:38.880
no one dares to kill me.

03:39.520 --> 03:41.296
Instead, they'll do everything possible

03:41.320 --> 03:42.495
to keep me alive.

03:43.370 --> 03:44.520
Do you know why?

03:47.645 --> 03:49.870
With North Liang Army around,

03:50.395 --> 03:52.545
you can live without any anxiety!

03:53.945 --> 03:54.945
Here I go.

04:01.345 --> 04:02.016
Godfather.

04:02.040 --> 04:02.695
What?

04:02.795 --> 04:04.840
Who'll lead North Liang Army?

04:06.670 --> 04:07.920
No one can guard North Liang,

04:08.070 --> 04:09.445
but Chen Zhibao.

04:15.470 --> 04:18.227
(Liang)

04:32.895 --> 04:34.170
Hawk.

04:35.720 --> 04:37.395
Sword tassel.

04:46.770 --> 04:48.120
Go fetch my bed.

04:48.270 --> 04:50.120
I'll be waiting here
for the sword tassel.

04:52.995 --> 04:54.416
I'm talking to you.

04:54.440 --> 04:55.221
Go move my bed here.

04:55.245 --> 04:56.245
Yes.

04:56.670 --> 04:57.670
Quickly!

06:00.545 --> 06:01.545
Armor.

06:03.370 --> 06:04.745
Fujiang Armor?

06:07.370 --> 06:09.120
Grandpa Wei, you know him?

06:09.420 --> 06:11.240
When I was as young as you,

06:11.270 --> 06:12.047
in this world,

06:12.071 --> 06:13.471
there used to be four Great Masters.

06:13.495 --> 06:14.616
One of them

06:14.640 --> 06:15.871
was Fujiang Armor

06:15.895 --> 06:17.220
from the South.

06:29.370 --> 06:30.945
The man ahead of us?

06:31.945 --> 06:32.945
But...

06:33.195 --> 06:34.336
When Fujiang Armor

06:34.360 --> 06:35.760
assassinated the late emperor,

06:36.045 --> 06:37.256
Cruel Cat Han Diaosi

06:37.280 --> 06:38.520
took off the Armor personally.

06:38.695 --> 06:39.971
His dead body and the Armor

06:39.995 --> 06:41.695
were hung on the flag for display.

06:42.195 --> 06:43.420
It can't be faked.

06:44.000 --> 06:45.000
That's weird.

06:45.420 --> 06:46.795
Where did he get this armor?

06:47.120 --> 06:49.270
Can he be the child
of Fujiang Armor?

06:49.545 --> 06:50.545
No way.

06:50.920 --> 06:52.960
There's only one Fujiang Armor
in this world.

06:53.220 --> 06:53.922
Now,

06:53.946 --> 06:55.826
the Armor should be kept
in the Imperial Palace.

06:56.070 --> 06:57.070
Let me try him out.

06:57.520 --> 06:59.070
You don't need to take the risk.

06:59.470 --> 07:00.271
Shu Xiu.

07:00.295 --> 07:01.295
Lyu Qiantang.

07:04.895 --> 07:05.920
May I borrow your horse?

07:06.895 --> 07:07.960
As you wish.

07:14.770 --> 07:16.240
Which one of us should go first?

07:16.295 --> 07:18.445
Shouldn't we go in turn?

07:24.170 --> 07:25.170
He's alive.

07:50.870 --> 07:51.870
Luckily,

07:52.320 --> 07:54.445
he's not Fujiang Armor Man
among four Great Masters.

07:54.945 --> 07:56.270
Who told you that?

07:58.195 --> 07:59.176
Fujiang Armor

07:59.200 --> 08:00.560
should have been stronger.

08:00.920 --> 08:02.056
The Armor is from Mount Longhu.

08:02.080 --> 08:03.520
It's ancient armor.

08:04.320 --> 08:05.400
But few people know

08:05.440 --> 08:07.320
that it can be divided into five armors,

08:07.420 --> 08:08.560
referring to five elements.

08:08.795 --> 08:10.670
Metal, wood, water, fire, and earth?

08:11.945 --> 08:13.145
This is the Water Armor.

08:13.245 --> 08:15.120
It's the strongest in the heavy rain.

08:15.595 --> 08:16.945
They can't defeat him.

08:17.195 --> 08:18.435
Ask them to get out of the way.

08:18.745 --> 08:19.745
Stop.

08:20.570 --> 08:21.570
Come back!

08:44.295 --> 08:45.645
He's coming towards me.

09:27.745 --> 09:29.020
It's over?

09:35.945 --> 09:37.656
When Fujiang Armor is divided
into five bodies,

09:37.680 --> 09:39.545
they aren't as strong as the entirety.

09:39.820 --> 09:42.080
But they still can't be easily defeated.

09:48.895 --> 09:50.160
He isn't dead yet?

09:52.070 --> 09:53.445
A living death.

09:53.970 --> 09:55.595
He's not exactly a living person.

10:14.495 --> 10:16.020
Making Immortals Kneel.

11:23.320 --> 11:24.600
Is he a human

11:25.295 --> 11:26.395
or is he an immortal?

11:53.995 --> 11:55.280
This old man is quite strong.

11:56.045 --> 11:57.400
I'm afraid I can't defeat him.

11:58.670 --> 12:00.360
It's really hard
to kill my brother-in-law.

12:01.195 --> 12:02.515
I can't assassinate him directly.

12:03.395 --> 12:04.555
I'll wait for another chance.

12:42.840 --> 12:44.320
Luckily, I use the blade.

12:45.920 --> 12:46.896
Otherwise,

12:46.920 --> 12:47.777
when I saw how you used the sword,

12:47.801 --> 12:48.936
I would have psychological scars

12:48.960 --> 12:50.480
and never dare to use the sword again.

12:50.820 --> 12:52.460
You don't use the blade
very well, either.

13:01.820 --> 13:03.220
What do you think of that, girl?

13:04.870 --> 13:06.195
Not as good as White Fox.

13:06.570 --> 13:08.095
She's strong.

13:08.370 --> 13:09.996
But far worse than me.

13:10.020 --> 13:12.000
She uses two blades
much more beautifully.

13:12.145 --> 13:14.020
I can use the sword beautifully, too.

13:14.595 --> 13:16.096
She looks prettier than you.

13:16.120 --> 13:16.770
Ah?

13:16.945 --> 13:18.220
Seriously?

13:18.960 --> 13:20.536
So, I won't be your disciple.

13:20.560 --> 13:21.595
Think no more of it.

13:22.445 --> 13:23.377
You are

13:23.401 --> 13:25.080
as talented as Xu Fengnian.

13:25.360 --> 13:27.270
If you learn from me,
you'll be a master.

13:28.245 --> 13:29.546
Considering my identity,

13:29.570 --> 13:30.536
the stronger I am,

13:30.560 --> 13:31.560
the sooner I'll die.

13:32.645 --> 13:34.600
You're afraid
that Xu Fengnian will kill you?

13:34.795 --> 13:36.120
I don't think he wants that.

13:36.295 --> 13:37.055
Bah.

13:37.295 --> 13:38.720
He's sinister and ruthless.

13:38.760 --> 13:40.020
He can do anything.

13:40.095 --> 13:40.977
I can teach you.

13:41.001 --> 13:42.200
Then you can defeat him.

13:43.220 --> 13:44.040
I won't learn.

13:44.195 --> 13:45.475
It's hard to learn martial arts.

13:46.245 --> 13:48.095
Let me know when you want to learn.

13:50.370 --> 13:51.870
Why must you teach me?

13:52.170 --> 13:53.620
You're talented.

13:53.770 --> 13:55.896
And you act arrogantly.

13:55.920 --> 13:57.320
I like that.

14:01.070 --> 14:02.070
What about him?

14:03.220 --> 14:05.220
He has a good talent.

14:05.895 --> 14:07.336
But he's scheming.

14:07.360 --> 14:08.570
I'll keep observing him.

14:29.570 --> 14:30.570
The two strokes

14:31.120 --> 14:32.022
killed him.

14:32.046 --> 14:33.120
But he looks alive.

14:33.470 --> 14:34.800
The last breath, I'm afraid.

14:37.220 --> 14:38.220
Dude,

14:38.595 --> 14:39.640
who are you?

14:40.070 --> 14:41.190
Why did you come to kill me?

14:46.320 --> 14:47.840
Looks like he doesn't want to tell me.

14:48.070 --> 14:49.710
It's not that
he doesn't want to tell you.

14:50.570 --> 14:51.570
He just can't tell you.

14:51.920 --> 14:52.545
Why?

14:52.870 --> 14:53.870
I checked on him.

14:54.045 --> 14:55.800
He's mentally disturbed.

14:56.320 --> 14:57.400
Mentally disturbed?

14:57.920 --> 14:59.295
But he was fighting normally.

15:02.970 --> 15:03.970
Look.

15:07.020 --> 15:08.595
It's carved

15:08.695 --> 15:09.395
all over the inner side of the Armor.

15:09.695 --> 15:10.695
What's it?

15:12.470 --> 15:13.595
As for the secret pattern,

15:14.170 --> 15:16.290
you have to ask that senior
in your carriage, I guess.

15:25.420 --> 15:26.420
Look.

15:27.620 --> 15:28.620
What's this?

15:29.070 --> 15:30.445
A piece of armor.

15:32.220 --> 15:33.560
What's carved on this side?

15:34.560 --> 15:35.560
It looks mysterious.

15:35.995 --> 15:39.145
I'm afraid no one knows it.

15:39.220 --> 15:40.995
It's evil of you.

15:41.170 --> 15:43.040
You're talking in riddles.

15:43.395 --> 15:44.400
You know?

15:46.370 --> 15:47.880
Tell us, then.

15:48.595 --> 15:49.795
It's the genuine spirit.

15:49.945 --> 15:51.070
Genuine spirit?

15:51.470 --> 15:53.945
The pattern is carved
with special material,

15:54.195 --> 15:55.920
for the circulation of genuine spirit.

15:56.395 --> 15:58.420
Genuine spirit circulates
through the patterns?

15:58.495 --> 15:59.896
More than that.

15:59.920 --> 16:01.600
The patterns can also
store genuine spirit.

16:01.840 --> 16:03.040
Most wonderfully,

16:03.395 --> 16:05.515
the patterns can transmit
genuine spirit to this part.

16:05.620 --> 16:06.820
Head?

16:07.445 --> 16:08.776
So, the man out there

16:08.800 --> 16:10.240
isn't born with superhuman strength.

16:11.170 --> 16:12.720
Fujiang Armor is vicious.

16:13.295 --> 16:14.295
A batch of death guards

16:14.470 --> 16:16.016
have been trained.

16:16.040 --> 16:17.856
Genuine spirit stored in the Armor

16:17.880 --> 16:19.040
can help them to kill.

16:19.370 --> 16:20.960
That's why I killed that man.

16:21.145 --> 16:22.345
Because everybody in the Armor

16:22.720 --> 16:24.495
would rather die than surrender.

16:36.680 --> 16:37.846
(Unknown man)
It's all right that we buried him.

16:37.870 --> 16:39.696
(Unknown man)
Why do we take away the Armor?

16:39.720 --> 16:40.971
(Unknown man)
It's quite an evil armor.

16:40.995 --> 16:42.096
(Unknown man) Let's study it.

16:42.120 --> 16:44.680
He said there were five Fujiang Armors.

16:45.070 --> 16:46.600
But only one came to kill me.

16:46.670 --> 16:48.480
It's hard to say
if the other four would come.

16:48.595 --> 16:50.670
Who told you only one came?

16:51.345 --> 16:53.920
Three armors were waiting
in the woods just now.

16:54.245 --> 16:55.121
Just now?

16:55.145 --> 16:55.822
Yes.

16:55.846 --> 16:57.016
Why didn't they come out?

16:57.040 --> 16:58.640
They were scared of me, of course.

17:00.270 --> 17:01.072
Wait.

17:01.096 --> 17:02.656
Only four in total.

17:02.680 --> 17:03.680
Where's the fifth one?

17:03.795 --> 17:05.080
How do I know?

17:06.070 --> 17:07.070
Oh, no!

17:07.720 --> 17:08.760
Ning Emei.

17:09.595 --> 17:10.595
Your Highness.

17:12.095 --> 17:13.095
Your Highness.

17:19.695 --> 17:20.600
You were attacked?

17:20.695 --> 17:21.695
Your Highness,

17:21.745 --> 17:23.616
a man in Armor
attacked Fengzi Battalion.

17:23.640 --> 17:24.640
What happened in the end?

17:24.695 --> 17:25.820
I'm sorry.

17:26.195 --> 17:27.946
More than forty soldiers
were wounded or dead.

17:27.970 --> 17:29.370
But we failed to keep him.

17:29.695 --> 17:30.840
We only drove him off.

17:31.245 --> 17:32.245
In the end,

17:32.545 --> 17:33.995
he ran away.

17:37.970 --> 17:39.271
Please punish me, Your Highness.

17:39.295 --> 17:40.295
I beg you

17:40.420 --> 17:42.460
to spare the remaining soldiers
of Fengzi Battalion.

17:45.545 --> 17:47.425
According to military rules
of North Liang Army,

17:47.620 --> 17:49.121
how should generals and soldiers
be punished

17:49.145 --> 17:50.345
for incompetence and failure?

17:52.020 --> 17:53.340
Flogging is the least punishment.

17:53.495 --> 17:54.560
Beheading is the harshest.

17:55.245 --> 17:56.960
We ran into a man in Armor, too.

17:57.920 --> 17:59.720
They two couldn't fight him.

18:00.445 --> 18:01.696
You've already done a good job

18:01.720 --> 18:02.560
when you drove him off.

18:02.695 --> 18:03.880
Let me ask you.

18:04.345 --> 18:05.345
During the fight,

18:06.045 --> 18:07.096
did anyone of Fengzi Battalion

18:07.120 --> 18:08.400
shrink back?

18:09.045 --> 18:10.245
None of them ever shrank back.

18:10.345 --> 18:11.825
Fengzi Battalion's men die in battle,

18:11.945 --> 18:13.146
but they never run for their lives.

18:13.170 --> 18:14.170
Good point.

18:15.345 --> 18:16.256
When half of you were wounded or dead,

18:16.280 --> 18:17.440
but you still fought bravely.

18:17.470 --> 18:18.995
You're indeed valiant.

18:19.320 --> 18:21.145
You fought bravely and won.

18:21.420 --> 18:22.820
You're not guilty, but meritorious.

18:25.595 --> 18:26.595
You may rise.

18:30.695 --> 18:32.020
Thank you, Your Highness,

18:32.470 --> 18:33.670
on behalf of Fengzi Battalion.

18:37.220 --> 18:38.345
Take the remaining soldiers

18:38.595 --> 18:39.595
back to North Liang.

18:40.545 --> 18:41.545
Looks like

18:41.670 --> 18:43.400
I'm going on a trip to destruction.

18:43.770 --> 18:45.271
North Liang Cavalry
is never afraid of death.

18:45.295 --> 18:47.000
Shouldn't dead soldiers be taken home?

18:49.170 --> 18:50.620
Take them back to North Liang

18:50.845 --> 18:51.920
and catch up with me.

18:52.670 --> 18:54.020
I'll slow down and wait for you.

19:17.720 --> 19:19.545
It was a nice trick to buy them over.

19:20.070 --> 19:21.400
It's hard to judge Ning Emei.

19:21.570 --> 19:22.417
But I think the other soldiers

19:22.441 --> 19:23.840
would like to die for you.

19:24.145 --> 19:26.025
It's not that easy
to buy over Fengzi Battalion.

19:26.845 --> 19:28.165
I don't want them to die, either.

19:28.245 --> 19:29.217
You're the son
of the Lord of North Liang.

19:29.241 --> 19:31.096
It's justified that they die for you.

19:31.120 --> 19:32.216
I take over North Liang,

19:32.240 --> 19:34.200
just to eliminate such justified things.

19:35.345 --> 19:37.040
You're a weird man.

19:38.720 --> 19:39.720
Forget it.

19:40.370 --> 19:42.640
Your sword moves were earthshaking.

19:42.745 --> 19:44.920
I can't help asking who you are.

19:45.345 --> 19:46.345
I use swords.

19:46.720 --> 19:47.795
You can guess.

19:48.545 --> 19:49.770
Don't bother.

19:50.745 --> 19:52.000
He's Li Chungang.

19:55.020 --> 19:57.270
(God of Sword Li Chungang)
How did you know?

19:58.945 --> 20:00.445
God of Sword Li Chungang?

20:02.370 --> 20:03.656
Sixty years ago,

20:03.680 --> 20:06.216
God of Sword Li Chungang was famous
all over the world.

20:06.240 --> 20:07.336
He used his sword Mumaniu

20:07.360 --> 20:09.400
to fight everywhere
and no one defeated him.

20:09.970 --> 20:11.521
I've heard about your sword.

20:11.545 --> 20:14.065
I nearly forgot who I was.

20:14.595 --> 20:17.420
Who else could remember Mumaniu?

20:22.495 --> 20:24.120
So, you heard it.

20:24.520 --> 20:25.995
Sixty years ago?

20:26.245 --> 20:27.720
How old are you now?

20:27.970 --> 20:30.610
Those who practice genuine spirit
live longer than those who don't.

20:30.695 --> 20:31.971
With Dahuangting in your body,

20:31.995 --> 20:33.520
you'll live longer than me.

20:33.695 --> 20:35.816
Now that you're the former God of Sword,

20:35.840 --> 20:36.621
where's your sword?

20:36.645 --> 20:37.645
Jiang Ni!

20:38.145 --> 20:39.270
What? It's taboo?

20:39.345 --> 20:40.470
Nothing is taboo.

20:41.045 --> 20:42.246
In the fight against Wang Xianzhi,

20:42.270 --> 20:43.120
he broke my sword Mumaniu

20:43.160 --> 20:44.400
with his two fingers.

20:45.570 --> 20:47.176
He won?

20:47.200 --> 20:47.937
My sword was even broken.

20:47.961 --> 20:49.245
He certainly won.

20:49.870 --> 20:52.495
Then you're going
to challenge Wang Xianzhi?

20:53.470 --> 20:55.016
I just want to get back the sword box.

20:55.040 --> 20:56.880
I don't have to challenge him.

20:58.145 --> 21:00.570
You knew Xu Fengnian would
visit Wudi City?

21:01.570 --> 21:02.257
I did.

21:02.281 --> 21:03.695
Then why are you still going?

21:04.045 --> 21:05.345
You think

21:05.870 --> 21:06.737
I've been hiding underground

21:06.761 --> 21:08.016
because I'm scared of Wang Xianzhi

21:08.040 --> 21:09.521
for losing to him
and having my sword broken?

21:09.545 --> 21:10.671
Isn't it the fact?

21:10.695 --> 21:11.576
Losing a fight

21:11.600 --> 21:12.600
never scares me.

21:13.320 --> 21:14.545
I stayed hidden

21:15.995 --> 21:17.420
only because

21:19.070 --> 21:21.645
I realized that I was an idiot.

21:30.710 --> 21:33.921
(Mount Qingcheng)

21:33.945 --> 21:34.772
Your Highness,

21:34.796 --> 21:35.936
if we choose

21:35.960 --> 21:37.146
to make a detour,

21:37.170 --> 21:39.050
it'll take us less than a day
to leave Yongzhou.

21:39.220 --> 21:40.536
But if we go through
the back of the mountain,

21:40.560 --> 21:41.946
I'm afraid it'll take a couple of days.

21:41.970 --> 21:42.970
I know.

21:45.370 --> 21:46.370
Your Highness,

21:47.245 --> 21:48.245
is he

21:48.270 --> 21:49.495
really Li Chungang?

21:50.795 --> 21:52.070
Yes, I think.

21:56.095 --> 21:57.495
What's wrong?

21:57.945 --> 21:58.995
Why are you so excited

21:59.245 --> 22:00.245
about his name?

22:01.220 --> 22:03.395
He's God of Sword Li Chungang.

22:05.470 --> 22:07.246
Masters appear one after another
in the martial world.

22:07.270 --> 22:09.995
But he was the strongest
for fifty years.

22:10.420 --> 22:11.776
His swordsmanship

22:11.800 --> 22:13.170
was the best in the world.

22:13.420 --> 22:14.456
He was the coolest swordsman

22:14.480 --> 22:15.995
in the world, too.

22:16.920 --> 22:19.160
Girls were crazy about him.

22:19.520 --> 22:21.670
Other swordsmen admired him.

22:21.820 --> 22:22.820
Shu Xiu,

22:22.920 --> 22:24.400
are you crazy about him, too?

22:24.695 --> 22:26.646
I grew up,
hearing a lot about his legends.

22:26.670 --> 22:28.045
To me,

22:28.245 --> 22:31.520
he's like the real god.

22:34.195 --> 22:35.870
Qingniao, you don't look excited.

22:36.095 --> 22:37.521
I'm a mere maid.

22:37.545 --> 22:38.800
I love rich guys.

22:39.470 --> 22:40.936
I'm not interested

22:40.960 --> 22:41.736
in a poor old man.

22:41.760 --> 22:42.621
Lin,

22:42.645 --> 22:43.645
what about you?

22:44.345 --> 22:45.656
Lyu Qiantang,

22:45.680 --> 22:46.680
what about you?

22:46.920 --> 22:48.045
Lyu Qiantang!

22:48.770 --> 22:50.680
I'm a scholar!

22:51.420 --> 22:53.095
If he could be Number One Scholar,

22:53.245 --> 22:54.640
I would admire him.

22:55.470 --> 22:56.560
Boring man.

22:57.970 --> 22:59.600
Let's hurry up.

22:59.870 --> 23:00.846
We'll live in the Taoist temple tonight

23:00.870 --> 23:01.910
where we can be sheltered.

23:02.470 --> 23:04.745
Why do I feel the closer
we get to Mount Qingcheng,

23:05.270 --> 23:06.720
the happier His Highness looks?

23:41.345 --> 23:43.056
How do you know here's a Taoist temple?

23:43.080 --> 23:44.570
I divined.

23:45.195 --> 23:46.440
You're awesome, then.

23:51.795 --> 23:52.795
Your Highness,

23:53.395 --> 23:54.395
the Taoist temple

23:54.820 --> 23:55.920
is a little bit weird.

23:56.370 --> 23:57.370
How?

23:57.395 --> 23:58.440
Trees in the backyard

23:58.570 --> 23:59.870
have been cut down.

24:00.170 --> 24:01.170
Oh.

24:02.495 --> 24:03.720
They were used

24:04.120 --> 24:05.495
to make a fire.

24:07.245 --> 24:08.440
Make a fire?

24:08.720 --> 24:09.970
I failed to find the firewood.

24:10.195 --> 24:11.360
Then I cut down the trees.

24:14.070 --> 24:15.070
So,

24:15.295 --> 24:16.680
you came here, Your Highness?

24:17.220 --> 24:19.170
Three years ago,
Old Huang and I lived here.

24:21.745 --> 24:23.345
You once had a hard life.

24:40.645 --> 24:42.120
Shu Xiu and Lyu Qiantang

24:42.745 --> 24:43.760
went out for hunting.

24:43.945 --> 24:45.040
Let's see

24:45.420 --> 24:46.900
if they can take back some game meat.

24:47.395 --> 24:48.770
It's good to have more people.

24:49.120 --> 24:50.646
When Old Huang and I stayed here,

24:50.670 --> 24:51.656
neither of us wanted to go out for food

24:51.680 --> 24:52.995
even if we fainted from hunger.

25:19.545 --> 25:20.545
Hey.

25:21.870 --> 25:22.870
Come over.

25:32.595 --> 25:33.635
Quick.

25:38.395 --> 25:39.395
What?

25:41.360 --> 25:42.360
What's this?

25:43.245 --> 25:44.360
Let's knock them out.

25:45.080 --> 25:46.145
Fengzi Battalion is away.

25:46.480 --> 25:47.960
Tonight is the best chance.

25:48.620 --> 25:51.200
Lyu Qiantang used to be a scholar.

25:51.395 --> 25:53.195
Looks like he doesn't have
great martial arts.

25:53.280 --> 25:55.170
Let's take him down first.

25:55.745 --> 25:57.195
You know him a lot.

26:00.800 --> 26:02.121
Have you heard me?

26:02.145 --> 26:03.620
It's a deal, then.

26:13.095 --> 26:14.576
You even found the white chickens

26:14.600 --> 26:15.816
on Mount Qingcheng.

26:15.840 --> 26:16.920
I'm getting a great feast.

26:17.195 --> 26:18.270
I'm glad you like it.

26:18.595 --> 26:19.595
Where's Lyu Qiantang?

26:19.895 --> 26:20.737
Out there.

26:20.761 --> 26:21.996
He said he would guard the carriage.

26:22.020 --> 26:22.770
Ignore him.

26:22.970 --> 26:23.936
He always pulls a long face.

26:23.960 --> 26:24.960
How annoying!

26:25.245 --> 26:25.847
Come on.

26:25.871 --> 26:27.020
I want the drumstick.

26:30.645 --> 26:32.020
Old Huang likes drumsticks, too.

26:33.370 --> 26:34.400
Jian Jiuhuang?

26:34.920 --> 26:36.395
I only know he's Old Huang.

26:36.645 --> 26:37.720
He's gluttonous and lazy.

26:38.020 --> 26:39.500
He's best at broiling sweet potatoes.

26:46.670 --> 26:47.297
Come on.

26:47.321 --> 26:48.345
Help yourself.

26:54.170 --> 26:55.595
Why are you holding a stick?

26:58.520 --> 26:59.640
To add fuel to the fire.

27:05.645 --> 27:06.970
Ridiculous.

27:15.095 --> 27:16.095
Your Highness,

27:16.670 --> 27:18.951
how long did you stay here
with Old Huang three years ago?

27:19.645 --> 27:20.795
For a few days.

27:24.245 --> 27:25.245
Why...?

27:26.245 --> 27:27.470
Why did you stay here?

27:29.620 --> 27:30.720
We didn't stay.

27:31.470 --> 27:32.720
We were caught by bandits.

27:33.770 --> 27:35.120
Bandits on Mount Qingcheng?

27:35.220 --> 27:36.220
Yeah.

27:36.295 --> 27:37.615
They came, upon seeing the flare.

27:37.895 --> 27:39.040
They didn't kill you?

27:40.520 --> 27:42.270
They were stupid bandits.

27:42.320 --> 27:43.680
Some were old and some were young.

27:43.995 --> 27:45.620
When they saw starving Old Huang and me,

27:45.670 --> 27:47.280
they gave us half of the roast chicken.

27:47.970 --> 27:49.445
What good luck you had!

27:50.170 --> 27:51.480
We became friends later.

27:51.670 --> 27:52.856
When I left Mount Qingcheng,

27:52.880 --> 27:53.960
they gave me a lot of food.

27:56.270 --> 27:57.595
You came back here

27:58.670 --> 28:00.150
because you wanted to see them again?

28:03.370 --> 28:05.195
I missed them a lot.

28:07.770 --> 28:09.195
If they see the flare,

28:10.120 --> 28:11.320
they may come.

28:18.220 --> 28:19.220
Give us your money!

28:26.920 --> 28:28.216
A lot of people here.

28:28.240 --> 28:30.396
- They're the stupid bandits?
- Take out your money.

28:30.420 --> 28:30.976
Take it out.

28:31.000 --> 28:31.920
- Not them.
- Give us your money.

28:32.020 --> 28:33.100
- It's weird.
- Take it out.

28:33.920 --> 28:35.721
This is supposed to be their territory.

28:35.745 --> 28:36.471
Boss.

28:36.495 --> 28:37.195
- Your Highness.
- Today,

28:37.270 --> 28:39.021
- I'm experienced in the martial world.
- We'll get a lot.

28:39.045 --> 28:39.921
Judged by my experience...

28:39.945 --> 28:40.622
We'll be too busy.

28:40.646 --> 28:42.496
There are two conditions

28:42.520 --> 28:43.696
where former bandits have been replaced.

28:43.720 --> 28:45.220
How dare you chat!

28:45.595 --> 28:47.016
- You totally ignore me?
- Yeah.

28:47.040 --> 28:48.040
Yeah.

28:48.070 --> 28:49.416
Take out your money!

28:49.440 --> 28:50.770
- Take it out!
- Take it out!

28:50.870 --> 28:52.200
Girls come here!

28:52.595 --> 28:53.420
First,

28:53.445 --> 28:54.946
- the former bandits were expelled.
- As for men,

28:54.970 --> 28:56.336
- What about the second?
- We'll kill them all.

28:56.360 --> 28:58.221
They were all killed by new bandits.

28:58.245 --> 28:59.336
As for girls,

28:59.360 --> 29:00.920
we'll enjoy them all.

29:02.445 --> 29:05.095
Holding a dagger, girl?

29:13.570 --> 29:14.570
Sirs,

29:15.070 --> 29:16.645
if I give this beautiful girl to you,

29:16.970 --> 29:18.000
will you let us go?

29:21.270 --> 29:22.745
We're dying, anyway.

29:23.045 --> 29:24.160
May I ask you a question?

29:24.945 --> 29:26.280
Where's Old Meng?

29:26.695 --> 29:28.095
Cut the crap.

29:28.295 --> 29:29.870
I'll kill you first.

29:31.170 --> 29:32.170
Shu Xiu.

29:32.970 --> 29:33.970
Your Highness.

29:35.095 --> 29:36.595
Don't let anyone of them run away.

29:38.145 --> 29:39.620
Try harder to fight me.

29:40.020 --> 29:40.746
Fight her!

29:40.770 --> 29:41.770
- Yes.
- Yes.

29:51.345 --> 29:52.480
Don't rush to leave.

29:52.820 --> 29:53.820
Come in and talk.

29:55.770 --> 29:56.770
Spare me.

29:59.395 --> 30:00.755
I'm sorry I didn't recognize you.

30:01.170 --> 30:02.320
Please spare my life.

30:02.970 --> 30:04.610
How long have you been
in Mount Qingcheng?

30:05.720 --> 30:06.720
For more than a month.

30:07.245 --> 30:08.670
In such a short time,

30:09.195 --> 30:10.835
you haven't built your own camp,
have you?

30:12.020 --> 30:15.020
The former bandits left the camp.

30:18.495 --> 30:19.576
You killed them?

30:19.600 --> 30:20.600
No, no.

30:21.820 --> 30:23.195
But I know

30:23.695 --> 30:24.695
they were in trouble.

30:24.820 --> 30:25.820
Trouble?

30:27.270 --> 30:28.270
What trouble?

30:28.845 --> 30:30.160
Immortals of Qingyang Sect

30:30.295 --> 30:32.240
took away a teenage girl.

30:32.720 --> 30:34.145
Old Meng and his men

30:34.520 --> 30:36.046
went to Qingyang Sect,
asking for the girl.

30:36.070 --> 30:37.070
In the end,

30:38.045 --> 30:39.120
none of them came back.

30:41.395 --> 30:42.520
Xiaoque'er?

30:44.595 --> 30:46.176
Why did they take her?

30:46.200 --> 30:48.216
I heard immortals of Qingyang Sect

30:48.240 --> 30:50.080
get stronger by hurting girls.

30:50.345 --> 30:51.665
Maybe they just wanted that girl.

30:54.695 --> 30:56.020
When was the girl taken away?

30:56.395 --> 30:57.720
Before we came here.

30:58.120 --> 30:59.200
Less than two months ago.

31:02.695 --> 31:03.776
What else would you like to ask?

31:03.800 --> 31:04.840
I've confessed everything.

31:07.670 --> 31:08.721
How many people have you killed?

31:08.745 --> 31:09.795
None.

31:10.020 --> 31:11.345
We're poor men.

31:11.995 --> 31:14.520
We didn't have a choice,
but to be bandits.

31:22.595 --> 31:23.595
Grandpa Wei.

31:25.245 --> 31:25.820
Here.

31:26.095 --> 31:27.596
There's a slope a bit further south.

31:27.620 --> 31:29.121
The camp is behind it.

31:29.145 --> 31:30.520
Please go and check it for me.

31:31.045 --> 31:32.045
All right.

31:37.595 --> 31:38.970
Watch them carefully.

31:39.120 --> 31:40.200
Don't worry, Your Highness.

31:40.295 --> 31:41.395
None of them can run away.

31:45.270 --> 31:46.670
Where are you going, Your Highness?

31:47.445 --> 31:48.320
I'm going for walk.

31:48.420 --> 31:49.420
I'll go with you.

32:08.645 --> 32:09.337
This is

32:09.361 --> 32:10.595
Yin-yang Pavilion.

32:11.020 --> 32:13.145
It's said to be
the boundary of Mount Qingcheng.

32:13.895 --> 32:15.775
It's the real world
at the foot of the mountain.

32:16.595 --> 32:17.445
On the mountain,

32:17.595 --> 32:18.595
it's the nether world.

32:20.645 --> 32:23.120
It's hard to distinguish them, isn't it?

32:23.470 --> 32:24.470
Yeah.

32:25.420 --> 32:27.376
It's always hard to distinguish them

32:27.400 --> 32:28.600
and it's hard to judge people.

32:47.895 --> 32:49.335
Give me the writing brush and paper.

32:57.070 --> 32:58.080
Keep still.

33:27.520 --> 33:28.520
Your Highness,

33:28.995 --> 33:30.120
it's quite dark.

33:30.295 --> 33:31.137
How do you manage

33:31.161 --> 33:33.295
to see the mountain so clearly?

33:35.845 --> 33:37.420
I came to this pavilion before.

33:38.445 --> 33:39.445
I've kept

33:39.870 --> 33:40.870
the scenery in my mind.

34:02.920 --> 34:03.920
Where are you going?

34:06.695 --> 34:08.295
I've drunk too much water.

34:12.220 --> 34:13.320
I'm afraid of the dark.

34:13.620 --> 34:15.120
I need her to go with me.

34:19.795 --> 34:20.795
Go.

34:28.420 --> 34:29.420
What again?

34:29.880 --> 34:31.040
When few people are around,

34:31.145 --> 34:32.270
we can sneak away.

34:32.795 --> 34:34.346
We've got nowhere to go.

34:34.370 --> 34:34.897
Come on.

34:34.921 --> 34:36.120
Don't waste time talking.

34:36.370 --> 34:37.640
Go with me, anyway.

34:37.670 --> 34:38.800
I'll take the cat with us.

35:09.170 --> 35:10.170
Your Highness.

35:10.445 --> 35:11.770
How did you find us?

35:12.420 --> 35:13.670
I saw the flare

35:13.870 --> 35:14.910
and I came to have a look.

35:16.370 --> 35:17.520
How's the camp?

35:17.645 --> 35:18.796
Many women were locked there.

35:18.820 --> 35:20.070
They were kidnapped.

35:20.445 --> 35:21.945
Their families were ruined.

35:23.095 --> 35:24.470
Don't they want to take revenge?

35:24.645 --> 35:25.645
They do.

35:25.795 --> 35:26.795
But they're scared.

35:28.095 --> 35:29.095
In the end,

35:29.295 --> 35:30.295
they all left.

35:31.620 --> 35:32.840
Will we send the bandits

35:33.895 --> 35:35.080
to the government?

35:47.870 --> 35:49.796
We're just kidding.

35:49.820 --> 35:51.145
We're not running away.

35:51.395 --> 35:51.977
We just...

35:52.001 --> 35:54.240
Xu Xiao only asked me
to protect Xu Fengnian.

35:55.195 --> 35:56.195
I don't interfere

35:57.070 --> 35:58.395
with anyone else.

36:12.495 --> 36:13.495
Off you go.

36:13.870 --> 36:14.870
I won't stop you.

36:21.570 --> 36:22.176
Let's go.

36:22.200 --> 36:23.200
Quickly.

36:24.945 --> 36:25.945
Don't bother.

36:27.220 --> 36:28.220
North Liang

36:28.880 --> 36:29.880
isn't far from here.

36:30.270 --> 36:31.670
If I run away,

36:31.820 --> 36:34.345
a message will be sent back
by a carrier pigeon.

36:34.845 --> 36:36.896
You should at least try.

36:36.920 --> 36:38.595
There isn't a chance.

36:40.145 --> 36:41.670
Why do we bother?

36:43.220 --> 36:44.220
Mm.

36:44.895 --> 36:45.895
I...

37:04.520 --> 37:06.220
I don't think you want to leave.

37:09.320 --> 37:11.095
You can hear us?

37:12.220 --> 37:13.945
I can whenever I want.

37:14.445 --> 37:15.670
What do you think, girl?

37:16.120 --> 37:17.880
Would you like
to learn martial arts from me?

37:18.720 --> 37:20.000
With martial arts,

37:20.320 --> 37:21.821
you can decide

37:21.845 --> 37:22.995
whether you stay or leave.

37:24.020 --> 37:25.020
I refuse.

37:41.670 --> 37:42.795
According to His Highness,

37:44.445 --> 37:46.205
the women are scared
after they've been hurt.

37:46.820 --> 37:47.820
But it doesn't matter.

37:48.370 --> 37:49.370
We'll take revenge

37:49.895 --> 37:50.895
for them.

37:54.045 --> 37:55.245
What does that mean?

37:56.345 --> 37:58.016
The women in the camp...

37:58.040 --> 37:58.822
You can't believe them.

37:58.846 --> 38:00.320
They're cheap women!

38:03.045 --> 38:04.416
We've got a lot of treasure.

38:04.440 --> 38:05.595
I can give it to you,

38:05.670 --> 38:06.920
as long as you let me go.

38:10.420 --> 38:11.420
Dig holes.

38:29.520 --> 38:32.544
(Villager Xiaoque'er)

38:38.995 --> 38:40.395
Why can't I blow out a sound?

38:40.695 --> 38:41.695
Let me teach you.

38:42.570 --> 38:43.170
Oh.

38:43.545 --> 38:44.640
Xu,

38:45.370 --> 38:47.270
I knew you would leave.

38:49.695 --> 38:51.056
I won't leave until I teach you.

38:51.080 --> 38:51.795
All right?

38:51.845 --> 38:52.845
Well,

38:52.870 --> 38:54.620
come back and visit me later.

38:54.920 --> 38:55.920
I will.

39:17.570 --> 39:18.850
It's wise of you, Your Highness.

39:19.370 --> 39:21.095
You've kept in mind the landform?

39:21.520 --> 39:23.160
I shouldn't waste my trip.

39:25.920 --> 39:26.971
They were killed.

39:26.995 --> 39:28.570
Shu Xiu and Lyu Qiantang

39:29.045 --> 39:30.045
buried them.

39:30.570 --> 39:31.570
Mm.

39:34.795 --> 39:36.395
What would you like to say?

39:36.845 --> 39:37.845
Your Highness,

39:38.370 --> 39:40.120
why didn't we send them
to the government?

39:43.045 --> 39:44.345
The government may not kill

39:44.745 --> 39:46.160
the criminals I give them.

39:47.270 --> 39:48.820
The court always defends

39:48.995 --> 39:50.320
the enemies of North Liang.

39:50.820 --> 39:51.495
And of course,

39:51.670 --> 39:53.400
they're mere bandits.

39:53.495 --> 39:54.655
They're of little importance.

39:54.895 --> 39:56.570
But just in case.

39:56.995 --> 39:58.840
They've killed so many people.

39:59.770 --> 40:02.040
I don't want them
to have any chance to stay alive.

40:02.745 --> 40:03.895
Those bandits

40:04.995 --> 40:06.395
deserve to be killed.

40:07.320 --> 40:09.295
Not all bandits are so cruel.

40:10.295 --> 40:11.595
When Old Meng was here,

40:11.920 --> 40:13.160
he never killed people.

40:13.595 --> 40:15.216
When he met poor men during the robbery,

40:15.240 --> 40:16.620
he even gave them money.

40:17.120 --> 40:19.856
He robbed Old Huang and me
when we didn't even have a single penny.

40:19.880 --> 40:20.896
When we left,

40:20.920 --> 40:22.520
he gave us a lot of money, instead.

40:24.670 --> 40:26.190
He and his men were righteous bandits.

40:26.220 --> 40:27.960
They weren't bandits.

40:28.870 --> 40:30.910
They were just villagers
who couldn't make a living.

40:31.345 --> 40:33.621
There were even the old and weak,
women and children among them.

40:33.645 --> 40:34.880
There was a little girl,

40:35.595 --> 40:36.680
named Xiaoque'er.

40:38.170 --> 40:40.400
She kept asking me to teach her
to blow the leaves.

40:41.695 --> 40:43.680
She often stole jerky
from Old Meng for me.

40:45.220 --> 40:46.336
The girl

40:46.360 --> 40:48.295
who was taken to Qingyang Sect?

40:53.195 --> 40:54.695
Wu Lingsu of Qingyang Sect

40:55.270 --> 40:56.560
was bestowed Lord of Qingcheng

40:56.970 --> 40:58.320
by the late emperor.

40:58.640 --> 40:59.970
He established Shenxiao Sect.

41:00.480 --> 41:01.760
It's a sect in the martial world

41:01.795 --> 41:03.395
as well as the spy for the royal family.

41:03.480 --> 41:04.936
Mount Qingcheng is the first pass

41:04.960 --> 41:06.370
outside North Liang.

41:07.070 --> 41:08.070
Actually,

41:08.370 --> 41:09.495
Wu Lingsu is spying

41:09.870 --> 41:11.520
on North Liang in the dark.

41:12.195 --> 41:13.195
I know.

41:14.070 --> 41:15.920
I had planned

41:16.570 --> 41:17.920
to avoid Qingyang Sect

41:18.880 --> 41:20.570
when I had to pass Mount Qingcheng.

41:22.295 --> 41:23.575
You did it right, Your Highness.

41:23.945 --> 41:24.697
At present,

41:24.721 --> 41:27.176
we're fighting for the inheritance
of the throne of North Liang.

41:27.200 --> 41:29.245
We can't have a dispute with Wu Lingsu.

41:31.245 --> 41:32.800
I promised Xiaoque'er

41:33.820 --> 41:35.245
that I would come back for her.

41:36.895 --> 41:38.545
She's been caught for two months.

41:40.470 --> 41:42.270
It's too late now.

41:49.620 --> 41:50.620
Yeah.

41:52.170 --> 41:53.170
It's too late.

41:55.895 --> 41:56.920
I can't save her.

41:59.695 --> 42:00.770
Put it away.

42:12.795 --> 42:14.656
To make a big difference,
one must be patient

42:14.680 --> 42:15.920
and weigh up the pros and cons.

42:17.220 --> 42:18.995
It's too late to save her, anyway.

42:19.695 --> 42:20.695
I can

42:22.770 --> 42:24.070
avenge her later.

42:35.320 --> 42:37.795
But what if she's still alive?

42:43.320 --> 42:44.320
Your Highness,

42:44.595 --> 42:45.915
you should focus on our big plan.

42:48.445 --> 42:49.445
Grandpa Wei,

42:49.495 --> 42:51.095
I'm afraid I can't
make a big difference.

42:51.720 --> 42:53.295
I'm going to break
into Mount Qingcheng.

43:30.000 --> 43:32.720
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.495 --> 43:37.295
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.220 --> 43:42.140
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.220 --> 43:47.020
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.320 --> 43:51.220
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.920 --> 43:55.740
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.745 --> 44:00.500
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.520 --> 44:05.445
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.945 --> 44:08.676
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.700 --> 44:09.940
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.720 --> 44:14.580
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.395 --> 44:18.121
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:18.145 --> 44:19.580
♪ The vanity ♪

44:20.070 --> 44:23.945
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.370 --> 44:25.721
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.745 --> 44:28.580
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.995 --> 44:31.476
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.500 --> 44:33.900
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.195 --> 44:36.221
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.245 --> 44:38.421
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.445 --> 44:42.660
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:43.020 --> 44:44.156
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.180 --> 44:47.220
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.395 --> 44:49.356
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.380 --> 44:52.100
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.660 --> 44:54.476
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.500 --> 44:56.996
♪ To start over ♪

44:57.020 --> 45:01.120
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
